        <p class="section-subtitle">PubMed 文獻 + ClinicalTrials 試驗自動關聯，每個藥物頁面都附帶證據包</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 md:gap-6">
        <div class="rounded-xl bg-white border border-neutral-200 p-6 text-center">
          <div class="text-4xl font-bold text-[color:var(--color-brand)] tabular-nums">~386.8K</div>
          <div class="mt-2 font-medium">PubMed 文獻</div>
          <p class="mt-2 text-xs text-[color:var(--color-ink-soft)]">每日自動檢索新發表，與預測藥物-疾病對自動匹配</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-xl bg-white border border-neutral-200 p-6 text-center">
          <div class="text-4xl font-bold text-[color:var(--color-brand)] tabular-nums">~242.9K</div>
          <div class="mt-2 font-medium">ClinicalTrials 試驗</div>
          <p class="mt-2 text-xs text-[color:var(--color-ink-soft)]">追蹤進行中與已完成的臨床試驗，提供強佐證</p>
